<title>SINGAPORE: Sime Singapore buys S$93.8 mln property.</title>
<headline>Sime Singapore buys S$93.8 mln property.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sime Singapore Ltd (SSL) said on Friday it had bought a 999-year leasehold property in the city for Singapore $93.8 million.</p>
<p>It said in a statement the purchase, through its unit, Banfora Pte Ltd, would be partly financed via a share sale to Sime Bank Berhad (SB).</p>
<p>The deal was conditional on approval from the relevant authorities including Bank Negara Malaysia.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
